sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant MaaSCtrl as maas-controller
    participant PayloadPre as payload-processing<br/>(pre-auth ext_proc)
    participant Authorino as Authorino
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api
    participant PayloadPost as payload-processing<br/>(post-auth ext_proc)
    participant KServe as KServe / External LLM
    participant Tenant as Tenant Client

    Note over Admin,Tenant: Workflow 2: Multi-Tenant Model Access (MaaS)

    Admin->>MaaSCtrl: Create AITenant,<br/>MaaSSubscription,<br/>MaaSAuthPolicy CRDs
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSCtrl: Reconcile tenant:<br/>create HTTPRoutes,<br/>Kuadrant AuthPolicy,<br/>TokenRateLimitPolicy,<br/>EnvoyFilter (ext_proc)

    Note over Tenant,KServe: Tenant inference request
    Tenant->>PayloadPre: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(HTTPS, API key header)
    PayloadPre->>PayloadPre: Extract model name,<br/>set X-Gateway-Model-Name
    PayloadPre->>Authorino: Forward for auth<br/>(with model header)
    Authorino->>MaaSAPI: HTTP callback:<br/>validate API key (SHA-256)
    MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Key valid,<br/>tenant context
    Authorino-->>PayloadPost: Auth passed,<br/>forward to post-auth
    PayloadPost->>PayloadPost: API translation<br/>(OpenAI to native),<br/>credential injection,<br/>stream usage enforcement
    PayloadPost->>KServe: Forward to backend<br/>(HTTPS, injected creds)
    KServe-->>PayloadPost: Inference response
    PayloadPost-->>Tenant: Translated response<br/>(HTTPS, rate-limited)

