sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant DSP as DS Pipelines<br/>(api-server)
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows<br/>(workflow-controller)
    participant StepPod as Pipeline Step Pods
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>(gRPC store)
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry
    participant KServe as KServe

    Note over User,KServe: Workflow 3: Data Science Pipeline Execution

    User->>Dashboard: Submit pipeline definition<br/>(IR YAML or Python SDK)
    Dashboard->>DSP: Create pipeline run<br/>(HTTP, kube-rbac-proxy auth)
    DSP->>DSP: Store pipeline definition,<br/>schedule execution
    DSP->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>(K8s API)
    Argo->>StepPod: Create execution pods<br/>per pipeline step<br/>(manage DAG dependencies)

    loop For each pipeline step
        StepPod->>StepPod: Execute ML task<br/>(training, eval, processing)
        StepPod->>MLMD: Log artifacts<br/>and lineage<br/>(gRPC)
        StepPod->>StepPod: Upload artifacts to S3<br/>(HTTPS, AWS IAM)
    end

    StepPod->>ModelReg: Register model version<br/>(gRPC)
    ModelReg-->>Dashboard: Model available<br/>for serving
    User->>Dashboard: Deploy model to serving
    Dashboard->>KServe: Create InferenceService CR
    KServe->>KServe: Deploy model endpoint

