sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant TrainOp as Training Operator
    participant Kueue as Kueue<br/>(Job Scheduler)
    participant K8sSched as Kubernetes Scheduler
    participant KubeRay as KubeRay Operator
    participant Workers as Worker Pods
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>(Experiment Tracking)

    Note over User,MLflow: Workflow 4: Distributed Training with Job Scheduling

    User->>Dashboard: Create TrainJob/PyTorchJob<br/>specifying distributed params
    Dashboard->>TrainOp: Submit training CR<br/>(K8s API)
    TrainOp->>TrainOp: Reconcile training job,<br/>create per-replica pods
    TrainOp->>Kueue: Submit workload for<br/>admission control
    Kueue->>Kueue: Check ClusterQueue quotas,<br/>apply scheduling gates for<br/>topology-aware placement
    Kueue->>K8sSched: Release scheduling gates<br/>(workload admitted)
    K8sSched->>Workers: Schedule worker pods

    opt Ray-based Training
        KubeRay->>KubeRay: Create RayCluster<br/>with OAuth proxy sidecar
        KubeRay->>Workers: Inject mTLS certs<br/>(CodeFlare Operator)
    end

    Workers->>Workers: Execute distributed training<br/>(PyTorch DDP, Horovod, Ray)
    Workers->>MLflow: Report metrics,<br/>log experiments<br/>(HTTP)
    Workers->>Workers: Save checkpoints to S3<br/>(HTTPS, AWS IAM)

    User->>Dashboard: Monitor training progress
    Dashboard->>Kueue: Query workload status<br/>(K8s API)
    Dashboard-->>User: Show training metrics<br/>and resource usage

