sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard<br/>(Eval Hub)
    participant TrustyAIOp as TrustyAI Operator
    participant TrustyAISvc as TrustyAI Service
    participant LMEval as lm-evaluation-harness
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>(InferenceService)
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry

    Note over User,ModelReg: Workflow 5: Model Fairness and Evaluation

    User->>Dashboard: Configure TrustyAI monitoring<br/>or create LMEvalJob<br/>via Eval Hub UI
    Dashboard->>TrustyAIOp: Create TrustyAI CR<br/>or LMEvalJob CR

    alt Fairness Monitoring
        TrustyAIOp->>TrustyAISvc: Deploy TrustyAI Service<br/>watching InferenceServices
        TrustyAISvc->>KServe: Patch InferenceService Logger<br/>(capture inference payloads)
        KServe-->>TrustyAISvc: Forward inference payloads
        TrustyAISvc->>TrustyAISvc: Compute fairness metrics<br/>(SPD, DIR)
        TrustyAISvc->>Prom: Expose fairness metrics<br/>at /metrics endpoint
    end

    alt Batch Evaluation
        TrustyAIOp->>LMEval: Create evaluation Pod<br/>(driver sidecar pattern)
        LMEval->>KServe: Execute batch evaluation<br/>against model endpoint
        KServe-->>LMEval: Inference results
        LMEval->>LMEval: Compute benchmark scores
        LMEval->>ModelReg: Store benchmark results<br/>(gRPC)
    end

    User->>Dashboard: View evaluation results
    Dashboard->>ModelReg: Fetch benchmark data
    Dashboard->>Prom: Query fairness metrics
    Dashboard-->>User: Show model quality<br/>and fairness dashboard
